-*   **Opacity Clamping:** The resulting $\alpha_{sample}$ may exceed 1.0. Standard compositing assumes $\alpha \in [0, 1]$. The implementation should clamp $\alpha_{sample}$ to $[0, 1]$ if necessary [G].
